          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kosodi kedol apaaran nakitomonet kaoŋon, nakikaleleor aŋolol naka Adiria, bala kidiŋ ebai koomitos ikekwaŋak ebe aapikis neeonit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitemo, kodumut aidules akaisaarei; kiyatakis edit kitemo bobo, kodumut aidules atomon kakany. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kokuriakaros aipok katiban, koosikis idoboi iwoŋon lukitapaikinet kokori, kilipa akwap aiwalar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakekototor ikekwaŋak aisii kataker, apotu kijoliliosi itaker toma aŋolol, kijoseikinito bala eosikinete idoboi lukitapaikinet kokume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolimok Paul ekapolokiton ka iserikalei ebe, “Dimikito esalete ituŋa lu ataker, mam ipedorete aitajario.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kosodete iserikalei aitub aunoi nuka itaker, kojalakis kodo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
